<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF likely to offer T-bills on Wed - sources.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF likely to offer T-bills on Wed - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance is likely to offer Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Wednesday next week, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue will likely be the roll-over of about 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month T-bills maturing on November 11, market sources said.</p>
</text>
